---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Service — December"
  description="Terms of Service governing the use of December software and cloud services."
  canonicalUrl="https://trydecember.com/terms"
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white mb-2">Terms of Service</h1>
    <p class="text-sm font-mono text-[#888888] mb-8">Last Updated: September 2026</p>

    <div class="prose prose-invert max-w-none text-[#cccccc] space-y-6 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">
      <p>
        These Terms of Service ("Terms") govern your access to and use of December's software applications, CLI tools, and cloud services provided by Phasehumans.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mt-8 mb-4 border-b border-[#222222] pb-2">1. Use of Services</h2>
      <p>
        You are responsible for your use of December and any content, prompts, or code processed through the system. You agree not to use December for unauthorized vulnerability scanning, generation of malicious software, or violating third-party intellectual property rights.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mt-8 mb-4 border-b border-[#222222] pb-2">2. Code Ownership</h2>
      <p>
        <strong>Your Code Remains Yours:</strong> You retain full ownership and intellectual property rights over all code, repositories, and prompts submitted to December, as well as all code outputs generated during your sessions.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mt-8 mb-4 border-b border-[#222222] pb-2">3. Subscriptions & Billing</h2>
      <p>
        December offers free tiers (including Bring Your Own Key) and paid subscription options. Cloud compute credits and subscription fees are billed in accordance with the pricing terms presented at the time of purchase.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mt-8 mb-4 border-b border-[#222222] pb-2">4. Disclaimers</h2>
      <p>
        December is an AI-assisted development tool provided "as is". Developers remain responsible for reviewing, testing, and verifying code before deploying it to production environments.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mt-8 mb-4 border-b border-[#222222] pb-2">5. Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions about these Terms may be directed to <a href="mailto:team@trydecember.com" class="text-blue-400 hover:underline">team@trydecember.com</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
